0.10.0 (2026-03-16)

  - Add the agent driver abstraction, with two drivers: claude-code
    and fake, a test double.
  - Add the driver field to swarm.json, top-level and per agent.
  - Validate the driver interface on startup and reject unknown
    drivers before any container starts.
  - Let drivers map generic config to CLI-specific Docker environment
    variables.
  - Read SWARM_MODEL and SWARM_EFFORT in the dashboard.
  - Guard dashboard 'p' when post_process is not configured.
  - Document dry runs with the fake driver.

0.9.3 (2026-03-12)

  - Set CLAUDE_CODE_ATTRIBUTION_HEADER=0 so local models keep their
    KV cache.
  - Disable telemetry and nonessential traffic in agent containers.
  - Refuse --agents with a config file that defines agent groups.

0.9.2 (2026-03-10)

