0.6.0 (2026-03-04)

  - Show per-group prompt tags and a tree-style agent summary in the
    dashboard header.
  - Add a pre-commit hook that guards submodule pointers.
  - Add a post-rewrite hook that re-injects provenance trailers.
  - Do not recurse into submodules on 'git fetch'.
  - Reclaim workspace ownership after a sudo setup.

0.5.0 (2026-03-04)

  - Add a per-group prompt override in swarm.json.

0.4.0 (2026-03-04)

