  - Skip the session when the prompt file is missing.

0.3.0 (2026-03-03)

  - Stream activity: a live tool-call feed from stream-json output, in
    'launch.sh logs N' and under the dashboard's [1-9] keys.

0.2.0 (2026-02-27)

  - Add swarm.json for per-agent model groups.
  - Add the TUI dashboard, with per-agent cost, tokens, cache, turns,
    throughput and duration.
  - Add costs.sh, a cost and usage summary.
  - Add an interactive setup wizard (setup.sh).
  - Add the wait and post-process commands.
  - Select the auth source per agent; accept
    CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN in place of an API key.
  - Support an effort level per agent and globally.
  - Inject Git coordination rules through the system prompt.
  - Add --help to every script.
  - Move model provenance from the Git author name to commit trailers.
  - Add the VERSION file.
  - Prefix project environment variables with SWARM_.
  - Move internal files into lib/ and tests into tests/.

0.1.0 (2026-02-10)

  - Initial release: N Claude Code instances in Docker, coordinating
    through Git.
  - Mirror the checkout into a bare repo, with a workspace clone per
    agent.
  - Loop in the harness: reset to origin/agent-work, run one session,
    push.
  - Add harvest.sh, which merges agent work into the host branch.
  - Configure the Git identity with GIT_USER_NAME and
    GIT_USER_EMAIL.
